WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.575
Hi, friends. This is The Energy Grid.

00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:17.151
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:19.896
Hands flat on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.896 --> 00:00:22.641
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:29.961
Your body runs on energy, like a battery. And batteries can be read.

00:00:29.961 --> 00:00:38.197
Sometimes the battery is low. Sometimes it is buzzing and full. Sometimes it is right in the middle.

00:00:38.197 --> 00:00:44.602
The Energy Grid is one question: how full is my battery right now?

00:00:44.602 --> 00:00:50.092
Each reading has a match — something that fits it. Let's read all three.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:57.413
Low feels like this: heavy body, slow thoughts, a yawn that wants to come.

00:00:57.413 --> 00:01:03.818
Pretend your battery is low. The match for low is gentle movement.

00:01:03.818 --> 00:01:09.309
Stretch your arms up slowly… and let them float down. Wiggle your fingers.

00:01:09.309 --> 00:01:13.884
Gentle movement wakes a low battery, slowly and kindly.

00:01:13.884 --> 00:01:20.289
High feels like this: buzzy, bouncy, hard to sit in your seat.

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:26.695
Pretend your battery is buzzing. The match for high is stillness and slow breaths.

00:01:26.695 --> 00:01:33.100
Feet flat. Hands flat. Breathe in slowly… and let it out even slower.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:39.505
Stillness gives a full battery somewhere calm to land.

00:01:39.505 --> 00:01:46.826
Middle feels like this: awake, steady, ready. The match for middle is learning.

00:01:46.826 --> 00:01:53.231
Now read your own battery, for real. Low, middle, or buzzing high — whichever is true.

00:01:53.231 --> 00:01:58.722
You know the matches now. Your body tells you, and you know what fits.

00:01:58.722 --> 00:02:05.127
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:05.127 --> 00:02:08.787
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:08.787 --> 00:02:12.447
You're ready for what's next.
